{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261125%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳案　前夫、家翁及大伯否認謀殺罪｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　25庭　暫委法官鄧少雄<br/>興達大廈大維修圍標案｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸沙田法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官黃國輝<br/>男子涉健身中心更衣室裝針孔攝影機｜再提堂<br/>► 0930　6庭　裁判官陳志輝<br/>六旬男子否認城巴上以飛機杯搖晃下體｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸粉嶺法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官香淑嫻<br/>男子涉於宏福苑限制飛行區操控無人機｜答辯<br/>宏福苑五級火　訛稱曾為屋苑居民圖騙援助金　無業男被控企圖欺詐罪｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官朱文瀚<br/>車禍女乘客自行求醫一周後死亡　休班警被改控危險駕駛｜答辯</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>► 1100　14庭　主任裁判官蘇文隆<br/>29歲女子涉吸毒及虐待1個半月大嬰兒｜再提堂</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T14:24:00.497369+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":430,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T14:12:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T20:08:16.469342+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T14:17:20.650501+00:00","content_hash":"f01603560e8f2bb70615d304b6bb88c1deae088a86dcd24499cf4d0caafa22f2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}